id: jump-start
name: Jump Start
talentCategory: starter
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  You seize the initiative in battle, allowing you to get the jump on your enemies.
text: >
  Jump Start: You seize the initiative in battle, allowing you to get the jump on your enemies.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  (1)-[Triggered/Start of Turn, 1/Encounter]: Use the Power Up Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.
  (2)-[Triggered/Start of Combat Round, 1/Encounter]: Take your Turn immediately, ignoring the current Initiative Order. If multiple characters apply this effect, they take their turns in order of highest to lowest Initiative Value.

---

# (1) On your turn's card, ticked - never Automatic, it hands over an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver: the Power Up out of sequence
# (chat.mjs jumpStartPower).
[triggered/start-of-turn, 1/encounter, outOfSequence, effect 1]
jumpStartPower();

# (2) On the Round's card, the player's to time: your Initiative above everyone's for this Round, and the turn yours now -
# whoever's it was takes it up again after yours; one already Jump Started on their turn, yours straight after theirs, the
# higher Initiative first (chat.mjs jumpStart; combat.mjs).
[triggered/start-of-round, 1/encounter, chosen, effect 2]
jumpStart();
